      "language": "Python",
      "code": "class Solution:\n    def searchInsert(self, nums: list[int], target: int) -> int:\n        left, right = 0, len(nums) - 1\n        while left <= right:\n            mid = (left + right) // 2\n            if nums[mid] < target:\n                left = mid + 1\n            else:\n                right = mid - 1\n        return left\n",
